This patch is needed because Nautilus includes
libportal-gtk4/portal-gtk4.h, a path that only exists once libportal is
installed. Built as part of the Nautilus build, the header is only at
libportal/portal-gtk4.h.

This adds a header at the installed path that includes the real one.

diff --git a/libportal-gtk4/portal-gtk4.h b/libportal-gtk4/portal-gtk4.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ca41cd4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/libportal-gtk4/portal-gtk4.h
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+/* The installed location of this header. In the source tree it is in libportal/. */
+#include <libportal/portal-gtk4.h>
